"Act Three\">Act Three</a>.\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Zhent Elf can be summoned with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gather_Your_Allies_(class_action)\" title=\"Gather Your Allies (class action)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp/25px-Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp/38px-Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp/50px-Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gather Your Allies\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp/25px-Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/ce/Gather_Your_Allies_class_action_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gather_Your_Allies_(class_action)\" title=\"Gather Your Allies (class action)\">Gather Your Allies</a> variant, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Black_Fist_Enforcers\" title=\"Black Fist Enforcers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Black_Fist_Enforcers_Icon.webp/25px-Black_Fist_Enforcers_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Black_Fist_Enforcers_Icon.webp/38px-Black_Fist_Enforcers_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Black_Fist_Enforcers_Icon.webp/50px-Black_Fist_Enforcers_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Black Fist Enforcers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Black_Fist_Enforcers_Icon.webp/25px-Black_Fist_Enforcers_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Black_Fist_Enforcers_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Fist_Enforcers\" title=\"Black Fist Enforcers\">Black Fist Enforcers</a> together with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zhentmodeus\" title=\"Zhentmodeus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Zhentmodeus.png/25px-Portrait_Zhentmodeus.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Zhentmodeus.png/38px-Portrait_Zhentmodeus.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Zhentmodeus.png/50px-Portrait_Zhentmodeus.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zhentmodeus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Zhentmodeus.png/25px-Portrait_Zhentmodeus.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ee/Portrait_Zhentmodeus.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zhentmodeus\" title=\"Zhentmodeus\">Zhentmodeus</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zhent_Half-Elven\" title=\"Zhent Half-Elven\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Portrait_Zhent_Half-Elven.png/25px-Portrait_Zhent_Half-Elven.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Portrait_Zhent_Half-Elven.png/38px-Portrait_Zhent_Half-Elven.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/73/Portrait_Zhent_Half-Elven.png/50px-Portrait_Zhent_Half-Elven.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zhent Half-Elven\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/73/Portrait_Zhent_Half-Elven.png/25px-Portrait_Zhent_Half-Elven.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/73/Portrait_Zhent_Half-Elven.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zhent_Half-Elven\" title=\"Zhent Half-Elven\">Zhent Half-Elven</a>, if the party completes <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aid_the_Underduke\" title=\"Aid the Underduke\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aid the Underduke\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Aid_the_Underduke\" title=\"Aid the Underduke\">Aid the Underduke</a> and sides with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Zhentarim\" title=\"Zhentarim\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Zhentarim.png/22px-Portrait_Zhentarim.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Zhentarim.png/33px-Portrait_Zhentarim.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Zhentarim.png/44px-Portrait_Zhentarim.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Zhentarim\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Portrait_Zhentarim.png/22px-Portrait_Zhentarim.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ee/Portrait_Zhentarim.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Zhentarim\" title=\"Zhentarim\">Zhentarim</a>. She only shows up if <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fishbait_Arno\" title=\"Fishbait Arno\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Portrait_Fishbait_Arno.png/25px-Portrait_Fishbait_Arno.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Portrait_Fishbait_Arno.png/38px-Portrait_Fishbait_Arno.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/40/Portrait_Fishbait_Arno.png/50px-Portrait_Fishbait_Arno.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fishbait Arno\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/40/Portrait_Fishbait_Arno.png/25px-Portrait_Fishbait_Arno.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/40/Portrait_Fishbait_Arno.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Fishbait_Arno\" title=\"Fishbait Arno\">Fishbait Arno</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slick_Inatra\" title=\"Slick Inatra\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png/25px-Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png/38px-Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png/50px-Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Slick Inatra\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png/25px-Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Portrait_Slick_Inatra.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Slick_Inatra\" title=\"Slick Inatra\">Slick Inatra</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gravedigger_Karcen\" title=\"Gravedigger Karcen\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/07/Portrait_Gravedigger_Karcen.png/25px-Portrait_Gravedigger_Karcen.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/07/Portrait_Gravedigger_Karcen.png/38px-Portrait_Gravedigger_Karcen.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/07/Portrait_Gravedigger_Karcen.png/50px-Portrait_Gravedigger_Karcen.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gravedigger Karcen\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/07/Portrait_Gravedigger_Karcen.png/25px-Portrait_Gravedigger_Karcen.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/07/Portrait_Gravedigger_Karcen.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gravedigger_Karcen\" title=\"Gravedigger Karcen\">Gravedigger Karcen</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Phase\" title=\"Phase\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Phase.png/25px-Portrait_Phase.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Phase.png/38px-Portrait_Phase.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Phase.png/50px-Portrait_Phase.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Phase\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/Portrait_Phase.png/25px-Portrait_Phase.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/Portrait_Phase.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Phase\" title=\"Phase\">Phase</a> die prior to the Netherbrain battle.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Combat\">Combat</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Attacks_and_actions\">Attacks and actions</span></h3>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box-image nomobile\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Dash_bonus_action.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/93/Dash_bonus_action.webp/100px-Dash_bonus_action.webp, /w/im